Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:18.87,0wrt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\fn方正小標宋_GBK\1c313131\3cFFFFFF\3a20\blur0.2\bord1.3\b1\fsp1\fscx90\fs24\pos(358.733,310.667)}A組
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.74,0wrt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\fn方正小標宋_GBK\1c313131\3cFFFFFF\3a20\blur0.2\bord1.3\b1\fsp1\fscx100\fs24\pos(550.733,159.067)}巽·阿爾蒂尼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.74,0wrt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\fn方正小標宋_GBK\1c313131\3cFFFFFF\3a20\blur0.2\bord1.3\b1\fsp1\fscx90\fs24\pos(590.733,585.867)}B組
